# Main component Kconfig - for CMake-visible options

config USE_RADIO
    bool "Enable Internet Radio"
    default n
    help
        Enable internet radio streaming support with HTTP/ICY streams.

config BOARD_SKIP_BATTERY_ADC
    bool "Skip battery ADC polling"
    default n
    help
        Do not read the battery ADC. Emulators do not model the SAR ADC, so
        adc_oneshot_read() spins forever on the done flag with interrupts
        disabled and trips the interrupt watchdog.

config BOARD_SKIP_DISPLAY
    bool "Skip SPI display initialization"
    default n
    help
        Do not initialize the SPI LCD. Emulators do not model the GP-SPI
        completion flag, so spi_device_polling_transmit() during panel init
        waits forever.